<!-- Chosen Palette: Energetic & Vibrant Tech (Deep Blue #1E3A8A, Bright Cyan #06B6D4, Vivid Orange #F97316, Traffic Emerald #10B981, Alert Rose #E11D48) -->
<!-- Application Structure Plan: The SPA uses an interactive "Tabbed Simulation" approach. Since the Source Report is a guide for structuring a 4-tab Google Sheets workbook, the most logical architecture is to mirror these 4 tabs as interactive views within the SPA. Users can click through "Panel de Control", "Configuración", "Registro", and "Análisis" to understand how data flows from setup to daily logging, and finally into high-level dashboards and Pareto analysis. This structure directly translates the report's methodology into an explorable tool. -->
<!-- Visualization & Content Choices: 
1. Global KPIs (Panel) -> Goal: Inform -> Big Stat Cards + Donut Chart (Chart.js) -> Shows overall progress vs target. Justification: Best for quick executive summaries.
2. Machine Config (Config) -> Goal: Compare -> Horizontal Bar Chart (Chart.js) -> Compares theoretical capacities. Justification: Easy to see which machine carries the most load.
3. Daily Log (Registro) -> Goal: Change -> Line Chart (Chart.js) -> Tracks OEE over time. Justification: Shows performance stability.
4. Loss Analysis (Análisis) -> Goal: Organize/Relationships -> Mixed Pareto Chart (Bar + Line, Chart.js) -> Highlights top downtime reasons. Justification: Direct visual translation of the recommended Pivot Table/Pareto analysis. 
- Confirming NO SVG/Mermaid used. -->
<!-- CONFIRMATION: NO SVG graphics used. NO Mermaid JS used. -->
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Guía Interactiva: Control de Tonelaje y OEE en Sheets</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script>
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #F8FAFC;
            color: #0F172A;
            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
        }
        
        /* Chart Container Styling Requirements */
        .chart-container {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
            height: 350px;
            max-height: 400px;
        }
        @media (min-width: 768px) {
            .chart-container {
                height: 380px;
            }
        }
        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            .chart-container {
                height: 300px;
            }
        }

        /* Custom UI Styles */
        .tab-btn {
            @apply px-6 py-3 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider border-b-4 transition-colors duration-200 cursor-pointer;
        }
        .tab-btn.active {
            @apply border-[#06B6D4] text-[#1E3A8A] bg-cyan-50;
        }
        .tab-btn.inactive {
            @apply border-transparent text-gray-500 hover:text-[#1E3A8A] hover:bg-gray-100;
        }
        .section-content {
            display: none;
            animation: fadeIn 0.4s ease-in-out;
        }
        .section-content.active {
            display: block;
        }
        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
